# Real-LLM raw evidence stays local unless a redaction pass packages
# it. Raw per-case traces and raw per-run JSON eval reports both embed
# raw model `draft_text` / `draft_excerpt` content and are treated as
# raw evidence. The public-safe view is the redacted summary inside
# evidence_packs/financial_links_llm_v*/ and the matching cards/memos.
traces/local/llm_*/
